hub.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/5862a3dc234f81dfc0ca580bfd6cce8c60608eae))\n* **ci:** mask sk-, xox and npm_ provider tokens and short GitHub tokens ([9bb1963](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/9bb19639fa6c586f836dd152aef6ca486b6e98c6))\n* **ci:** mask structural credentials with bounded diagnostics ([b8398c3](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/b8398c38e7d92c8bb99dcbc87fdb2370a47e6e97))\n* **ci:** mask tuple, quoted-bearer, next-line, CLI-flag and double-equals credential forms ([2c80cc6](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/2c80cc637faf31c94ab8eb6cf3fbcf14db37cec2))\n* **ci:** raise the linear-time floor to 250 ms so shared-runner jitter does not fail linear code ([12281b8](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/12281b87fc5059e6606a7cc202559a3aa2aeb4bf))\n* **ci:** require a word boundary and an uncommented line in the add-mask guard ([7db34f2](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/7db34f20345d61370ca975e3d7222dfa94c61b4e))\n* **deps:** bump phoenix_html and ecto to patched releases ([6cb5112](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/6cb511270fbcd70e6c7a3e4c1d583aa4fd72fdbb))\n* **deps:** bump phoenix_html and ecto to patched releases ([e8252b3](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/e8252b3c21a140a0c5f500da07850dedd6f8920f))\n* **deps:** update example-host bandit to 1.14.1 to clear advisory ([4ebe37f](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/4ebe37fe893f8ef420379d1f27c83bca37c0ce33))\n* **deps:** update example-host bandit to 1.14.1 to clear advisory ([3eeb588](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/3eeb58812822b92201a4960958d9492594579aa6))\n* **release:** ignore the generated-by version stamp in the Info.plist golden comparison ([b934246](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/b934246d6003e3f4b668a5d6fa7c65c860e87d94))\n* **release:** ignore version-derived values in shell digest and seam fixture comparisons ([8ce322d](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/8ce322d77e275979ccbfe3e2eab40ef7ec243d70))\n* **release:** version-agnostic shell fixtures and shape-based action pins ([02585ab](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/02585ab21d01ee242c120b8ad4c36ba33a1f1325))\n</details>\n\n<details><summary>ios-core: 0.2.12</summary>\n\n## [0.2.12](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/compare/ios-core-v0.2.11...ios-core-v0.2.12) (2026-11-07)\n\n\n### Features\n\n* **196-03:** pin Swift vector executions with rebuilt resource controls ([b2dc413](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/b2dc413269e3f94dee2a02dcdfa36122ae912ed3))\n* **196-04:** enforce metadata reader corpus availability ([d4a74cf](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/d4a74cfc7804844bef275333314141dc9e9d2e12))\n* **196-04:** pin topology selection and inventory real readers ([75da76f](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/75da76f2afd5153e63db1519b50be26544ca2613))\n* **196-04:** prove both Swift reply corpus cases ([28bb00b](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/28bb00b8a08d6d62ecc5e5dcbab6314ac86e89e3))\n* **198:** Android foreign-host proof, parity ledger and Kotlin test floor ([00adfd2](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/00adfd23fb82ae97da2f0c0abb23b6d227791d1c))\n\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* **196:** make spec and structure ratchets fail on empty evidence ([88c8bdd](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/88c8bdd88c234c7d9c6b4cc8dbcc2fc9d63fe1be))\n</details>\n\n<details><summary>android-core: 0.2.12</summary>\n\n## [0.2.12](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/compare/android-core-v0.2.11...android-core-v0.2.12) (2026-11-07)\n\n\n### Features\n\n* **196-05:** prove Kotlin reply and metadata readers without vacuous evidence ([77c74b4](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/77c74b4b1a3ecbe21c26ce232b33e5cc65e5112a))\n* **196-05:** prove Kotlin request populations through clean Gradle builds ([38bef11](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/38bef11c6b948470201ec58fb5703682e4dcbb08))\n* **198-01:** extract listener boundary and harden SemVer to digit-only components ([8cb0dff](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/8cb0dff7e879d92198c87b9ed3d8811559a63f77))\n* **198:** Android foreign-host proof, parity ledger and Kotlin test floor ([00adfd2](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/00adfd23fb82ae97da2f0c0abb23b6d227791d1c))\n\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* **196:** make spec and structure ratchets fail on empty evidence ([88c8bdd](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/88c8bdd88c234c7d9c6b4cc8dbcc2fc9d63fe1be))\n* **198-12:** split three email-shaped literals the privacy scan flagged, values unchanged ([d1a60a6](https://github.com/szTheory/crosswake/commit/d1a60a6680ba366e74a89d4151800ac93897e665))\n</details>\n\n---\nThis PR was generated with [Release Please](https://github.com/googleapis/release-please). See [documentation](https://github.com/googleapis/release-please#release-please).","labels":[{"id":11085776731,"node_id":"LA_kwDOSfdRcc8AAAAClMOHWw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/szTheory/crosswake/labels/autorelease:%20pending","name":"autorelease: pending","description":null,"color":"ededed","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-11T18:45:38Z","updated_at":"2026-11-07T15:47:33Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"f96a2856af9309409b9fe95f6126702575531962","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"szTheory:release-please--branches--main","ref":"release-please--branches--main","repo":{"id":1240945009,"node_id":"R_kgDOSfdRcQ","name":"crosswake","full_name":"szTheory/crosswake","owner":{"login":"szTheory","id":28652,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NjUy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28652?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/szTheory","html_url":"https://github.com/szTheory","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/szTheory/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/szTheory/follow